---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const timeline = [
  { kind: 'Education', title: 'M.S. Engineering Data Science & AI', org: 'University of Houston', when: 'Aug 2026 – May 2028' },
  { kind: 'Experience', title: 'Graduate Research Assistant', org: 'Office of Institutional Research, University of Houston', when: 'Aug 2026 – Present' },
  { kind: 'Experience', title: 'Machine Learning Engineer', org: 'EmGenisys', when: 'Aug 2025 – May 2026' },
  { kind: 'Experience', title: 'Undergraduate Research Assistant', org: 'Oden Institute, The University of Texas at Austin', when: 'Sep 2023 – May 2026' },
  { kind: 'Education', title: 'B.S. Biomedical Engineering, Statistics and Data Science', org: 'The University of Texas at Austin', when: 'Aug 2022 – May 2026' },
];

const community = [
  { org: 'Tamil Youth Leadership Program (TYLP)', role: 'Founder', when: '2017 – Present', body: 'Led the effort that got Tamil formally recognized as a high school credit language by the Texas Education Agency. Also organized community food drives and library initiatives.' },
  { org: 'SEEK (Student Engineers Educating Kids)', role: 'Program Officer', when: '2023 – 2026', body: 'Mentored 100+ grade-school students per semester; coordinated 25+ college volunteers.' },
  { org: 'Seva Charities', role: 'Events Officer', when: '2024 – 2026', body: 'Led a university-wide fundraiser — $13,000+ raised in the 2025–2026 cycle.' },
];

const credentials = [
  { title: 'Claude Certified Architect — Foundations', org: 'Anthropic, issued Aug 2026', body: 'Agent design, Claude Agent SDK, Model Context Protocol, context management.' },
  { title: 'AWS Bedrock', org: 'Hands-on', body: 'Model access, quota management, and deployment — practical experience, not a certification exam.' },
];

const honors = [
  { title: "Engineering Dean's Masters Scholarship", org: 'University of Houston, 2026 – 2028' },
  { title: 'Thomas J. Watson Memorial Scholarship', org: 'IBM, 2022 – 2026' },
];
---

<Layout
	title="About — Rahul Raja Durai Murugan"
	description="Full background: education, experience, community work, and credentials for Rahul Raja Durai Murugan."
	current="/about"
>
	<article class="about sans">
		<header class="page-head">
			<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
		</header>

		<section class="bio">
			<p>I started in biomedical engineering because I wanted to sit at the intersection of learning theory and actually applying it through engineering — take something that's just math on a whiteboard and turn it into something that changes a real decision. Biomedical engineering put the highest stakes on that intersection: a tumor-growth model that's overconfident, a treatment-response prediction that's miscalibrated, those aren't abstract accuracy metrics, they're decisions a clinician might actually make. That's carried through everything since: modeling chemotherapy response in patient-derived xenografts at the Oden Institute, building an embryo-viability classifier at EmGenisys, and now a Graduate Research Assistantship at UH's Office of Institutional Research, doing the same kind of careful, accountable data work at an institutional scale.</p>
			<p>The agent-infrastructure half of what I do grew out of a practical need, not a trend — I built an agentic job-search pipeline and a real-time sports-forecasting system because I wanted tools that ran themselves reliably, not because "agentic" was the framing of the moment. I'm a Claude Certified Architect (Foundations), and the part I actually care about there is the boring-sounding half: context management, failure recovery, state that survives a bad day — the stuff that decides whether an autonomous system is trustworthy enough to leave running unattended.</p>
			<p>Outside of research and engineering, I founded the Tamil Youth Leadership Program in 2017, which led the effort that got Tamil formally recognized as a high school credit language by the Texas Education Agency — something that's mattered enough to keep doing for going on a decade.</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Timeline</h2>
			<ul class="timeline">
				{timeline.map((t) => (
					<li>
						<span class="kind mono">{t.kind}</span>
						<span class="body">
							<span class="title">{t.title}</span>
							<span class="org">{t.org}</span>
						</span>
						<span class="when mono">{t.when}</span>
					</li>
				))}
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Community &amp; leadership</h2>
			<ul class="stack">
				{community.map((c) => (
					<li>
						<p class="entry-head"><b>{c.org}</b> — {c.role} <span class="when mono">{c.when}</span></p>
						<p class="entry-body">{c.body}</p>
					</li>
				))}
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h2>Credentials &amp; honors</h2>
			<ul class="stack">
				{credentials.map((c) => (
					<li>
						<p class="entry-head"><b>{c.title}</b> — {c.org}</p>
						<p class="entry-body">{c.body}</p>
					</li>
				))}
				{honors.map((h) => (
					<li>
						<p class="entry-head"><b>{h.title}</b> — {h.org}</p>
					</li>
				))}
			</ul>
		</section>

		<p class="work-auth">Work authorization: F-1 Student authorized to work in the US on CPT — no employer sponsorship required.</p>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about { padding: 12px 0 40px; }
  .page-head { padding-bottom: 4px; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rose); margin: 0; }

  .bio { padding: 20px 0 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mauve-mid); margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .bio p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 74ch; margin: 0 0 18px; opacity: 0.94; font-family: var(--font-display); }
  .bio p:last-child { margin-bottom: 24px; }

  section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  h2 { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.09em; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 18px; opacity: 0.85; }

  .timeline { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--mauve-mid); }
  .timeline li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr auto;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 13px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mauve-mid);
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .timeline li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  }
  .timeline .kind { font-size: 10.5px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; opacity: 0.6; }
  .timeline .title { display: block; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .timeline .org { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 2px; }
  .timeline .when { font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.8; white-space: nowrap; }

  .stack { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .entry-head { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 4px; }
  .entry-head b { color: var(--rose); font-weight: 700; }
  .entry-head .when { opacity: 0.7; margin-left: 4px; }
  .entry-body { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.88; margin: 0; max-width: 68ch; }

  .work-auth { font-size: 12.5px; opacity: 0.7; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid var(--mauve-mid); padding-top: 20px; margin: 0; }
</style>
